# One-off scratch/probe scripts must NEVER be committed to the package root.
# See README "Skrip sekali-pakai". Real tests live in test/*.test.ts and are
# unaffected: these patterns are anchored to the package root (leading "/")
# and only cover .cjs/.js/.mjs, never *.test.ts.
/scratch*
/fix_*.cjs
/fix_*.js
/query_*.cjs
/query_*.js
/query_*.mjs
/test_*.cjs
/test_*.mjs
